# text = Thie hier an erðu uuarð mannum te mârðum obar thesan middilgard, that ina hier sô quikana kuningo thie bezto, libbendian an is lîchaman, sô hie io an thesun liahta ni staraf - ac sô gihaloda ina hier heƀanas uualdand endi ina thar gisetta, thar hie simlon muot uuesan an uuunnion, untat ina eft an thesa uuerold sendit hêr heƀanas uuard heliðo barnum, liodiun te lêro.
